}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"26f8dc64-5fad-4b94-8d98-ed54a9a99007"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Surface-like graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"44e1e3a7-0941-4a8c-b89b-403bec014182"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationCurvature",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the combinatorial Gaussian curvature at a vertex of a regular \
or uniform map; its sign says spherical, flat or hyperbolic"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"b4b8464c-536e-4a50-8674-5ca8922a5f7b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationEulerCharacteristic",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Euler characteristic V - E + F of a tessellation graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"4c8bc007-46cf-44f1-bb4a-91e364d658e6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationGenus",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the orientable genus of a tessellation graph, from its Euler \
characteristic"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"f861df83-1588-4876-a540-7dc3ebe73f81"],

Cell["\<\
waits: a test whether a graph is surface-like at a scale, its metric balls \
discs and its metric shells cycles\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"7a17a837-d4a7-4b07-97b6-e6ba5e6f5fb8"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Preparing a substrate", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"d3e4222d-c9fe-4725-9439-216ac4c125f4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CenterGraph",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the substrate cut to a fraction q of the way out from its \
centre"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"417f8c0d-156e-4d03-999c-f611ac5a40d9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["BoundarylessGraph",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] deletes every edge joining two rim vertices and then the \
vertices this isolates, an open window onto the geometry"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"cedf0cea-24ab-45e9-8ba6-7052c1978509"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["GraphExteriorBoundary",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the rim vertices of the whole graph, detected from vertex \
degrees"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"21bb47a6-0719-4cd6-850b-0eb2c908ce90"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Inflated substrates", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"eaafa2fd-4b22-4ee6-9aa6-e9b3ad0de356"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["InflateGraph",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] grows a fiber of extra vertices over every vertex, joined to \
its base vertex, with random edges between nearby fibers"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"1fbd5329-1f85-4a6a-b1c5-fcb4aa3f2a45"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["InflatedVertex",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
